{"ticker":"IEX","updated":"2026-11-07T00:03:11Z","profile":{"longName":"IDEX Corporation","shortName":"IDEX Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.idexcorp.com","fullTimeEmployees":8700,"marketCap":16673051648,"trailingPE":31.52639,"forwardPE":23.088243,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.5575957,"pegRatio":1.59,"targetMeanPrice":262.92856,"targetHighPrice":283.0,"targetLowPrice":228.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.083,"earningsGrowth":0.147,"grossMargins":0.44906,"operatingMargins":0.22328,"profitMargins":0.14646,"totalRevenue":3658299904,"beta":0.948,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":243.8,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":160.6,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.31},"summary":"IDEX Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, provides applied solutions in the United States, North America, Europe, Asia, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Health & Science Technologies (HST), Fluid & Metering Technologies (FMT) and Fire & Safety/Diversified Products (FSDP). The HST segment designs, produces, and distributes a range of precision fluidics, positive displacement pumps, powder and liquid processing technologies, drying systems, micro-precision components, pneumatic components and sealing solutions, high performance molded and extruded sealing components, and custom mechanical and shaft seals. This segment also offers engineered hygienic mixers and valves, biocompatible medical devices and implantable products, air compressors and blowers, optical components and coatings, ultra-precision diamond tools, and laboratory and commercial equipment, as well as precision photonic solutions, technical ceramics, hermetic sealing products, porous material structures, and flow control solutions. The FMT segment designs, produces, and distributes positive displacement pumps, valves, small volume provers, flow meters, injectors, other fluid-handling pump modules, and systems; and provides flow monitoring and other services. The FSDP segment designs, produces, and distributes firefighting pumps, valves and controls, and rescue tools; lifting bags and ","summary_zh":"IDEX Corporation 及其子公司在美國、北美、歐洲、亞洲和國際範圍內提供應用解決方案。它透過三個部門運作：健康與科學技術 (HST)、流體與計量技術 (FMT) 以及消防與安全/多元化產品 (FSDP)。 HST 部門設計、生產和分銷一系列精密流體、正排量泵、粉末和液體加工技術、乾燥系統、微型精密組件、氣動組件和密封解決方案、高性能模製和擠壓密封組件以及定制機械和軸密封。該部門還提供工程衛生混合器和閥門、生物相容性醫療設備和植入式產品、空氣壓縮機和鼓風機、光學元件和塗層、超精密鑽石工具、實驗室和商業設備，以及精密光子解決方案、技術陶瓷、氣密密封產品、多孔材料結構和流量控制解決方案。 FMT 部門設計、生產和分銷正排量泵、閥門、小容量校準儀、流量計、注射器、其他流體處理泵模組和系統；並提供流量監控等服務。 FSDP 部門設計、生產和分銷消防泵、閥門和控制裝置以及救援工具；起重氣墊和","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":164.83,"h":164.87,"l":162.22,"c":164.17,"v":738400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":163.8,"h":163.82,"l":161.0,"c":162.01,"v":557800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":161.61,"h":162.65,"l":159.4,"c":160.17,"v":786100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":160.58,"h":164.77,"l":160.58,"c":164.49,"v":743100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":164.22,"h":164.45,"l":160.55,"c":160.55,"v":394400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":161.47,"h":162.15,"l":159.97,"c":161.16,"v":677300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":161.23,"h":163.98,"l":160.8,"c":163.84,"v":747700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":164.19,"h":165.91,"l":159.18,"c":159.59,"v":1033300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":160.83,"h":163.07,"l":160.08,"c":162.06,"v":608200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":164.0,"h":164.75,"l":160.59,"c":161.03,"v":1828300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":160.86,"h":161.26,"l":159.0,"c":160.6,"v":661300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":161.36,"h":162.38,"l":159.15,"c":159.4,"v":478500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":159.15,"h":160.68,"l":159.06,"c":159.76,"v":630800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":159.0,"h":159.74,"l":158.19,"c":159.28,"v":835600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":159.8,"h":161.65,"l":159.29,"c":161.35,"v":489300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":162.4,"h":162.93,"l":160.58,"c":162.19,"v":691900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":162.07,"h":162.81,"l":160.35,"c":162.76,"v":690400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":161.58,"h":164.23,"l":161.0,"c":1